    return `${tocHeading}<section class="panel paper-acceptance-workflow" id="${esc(panelId)}" data-paper-id="${esc(entry.paper_id)}" data-paper-state="${esc(current)}"><div class="idea-panel-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">${pick("CANONICAL PAPER LEDGER · 投稿闭环真值","CANONICAL PAPER LEDGER · ACCEPTANCE TRUTH")}</div><h2 data-toc="false">${pick("科学证据已经冻结，但“论文能投稿”必须继续通过独立的成稿与审稿硬门","Scientific evidence is frozen, but submission still requires independent manuscript and review gates")}</h2><p class="section-intro">${esc(workflowIntro)}</p></div><strong>${Math.max(0,currentIndex)+1}/${PAPER_ACCEPTANCE_STAGES.length}<span>${pick("当前论文阶段","current paper stage")}</span></strong></div><div class="paper-acceptance-stage-grid">${stageCards}</div><div class="current-experiment-grid paper-acceptance-gates"><article><b>${pick("硬门 1 · Story Search → Manuscript","Hard gate 1 · Story Search → Manuscript")}</b><span class="experiment-status-badge status-${story.pass ? "pass" : "fail"}">${story.pass ? "PASS" : "LOCKED"}</span><p>${pick(`winner=${story.selected_story_id || "--"} · ${story.selected_story_title || "--"} · 有效候选=${story.valid_candidates || 0} · receipt=${hash12(story.story_search_sha256)}…。Story Search 只能重排已支持主张，不能扩张 scientific contract。`,`winner=${story.selected_story_id || "--"} · ${story.selected_story_title || "--"} · valid candidates=${story.valid_candidates || 0} · receipt=${hash12(story.story_search_sha256)}…. Story Search may reorder supported claims but cannot expand the scientific contract.`)}</p></article><article><b>${pick("硬门 2 · 双 Mock PC → Targeted Repair","Hard gate 2 · dual Mock PC → Targeted Repair")}</b><span class="experiment-status-badge status-${blind && artifact ? "pass" : "fail"}">${blind && artifact ? "PASS" : "LOCKED"}</span><p>${pick(`Blind Manuscript=${blind ? `${hash12(blind)}…` : "缺失"}；Artifact-aware=${artifact ? `${hash12(artifact)}…` : "缺失"}。两类审稿 receipt 必须来自同一 frozen paper contract，缺任一类都不能进入定向修复。`,`Blind Manuscript=${blind ? `${hash12(blind)}…` : "missing"}; Artifact-aware=${artifact ? `${hash12(artifact)}…` : "missing"}. Both review receipts must bind the same frozen paper contract; either missing mode blocks Targeted Repair.`)}</p></article><article><b>${pick("硬门 3 · Claim Audit → PDF QA","Hard gate 3 · Claim Audit → PDF QA")}</b><span class="experiment-status-badge status-${claimAudit.pass ? "pass" : "fail"}">${claimAudit.pass ? "PASS" : "LOCKED"}</span><p>${pick(claimAudit.pass ? `Claim Audit 已通过，receipt=${hash12(claimAudit.claim_audit_sha256)}…；PDF QA 可以按顺序进入。` : "当前还没有 Claim Audit PASS receipt，因此 PDF QA 仍被硬锁。Targeted Repair 完成后要逐条核对正文中的 claim ID、证据绑定、unsupported claim 与 limitation。", claimAudit.pass ? `Claim Audit passed, receipt=${hash12(claimAudit.claim_audit_sha256)}…; PDF QA may advance in sequence.` : "There is no passing Claim Audit receipt yet, so PDF QA remains hard-locked. After Targeted Repair, audit manuscript claim IDs, evidence bindings, unsupported claims, and preserved limitations.")}</p></article><article><b>${pick("硬门 4 · Manuscript CI + Prebuttal → Submission Ready","Hard gate 4 · Manuscript CI + Prebuttal → Submission Ready")}</b><span class="experiment-status-badge status-${manuscriptCI.pass && prebuttal.pass && submissionReadiness.submission_ready ? "pass" : "fail"}">${manuscriptCI.pass && prebuttal.pass && submissionReadiness.submission_ready ? "PASS" : "LOCKED"}</span><p>${pick(`Manuscript CI=${manuscriptCI.pass ? `${manuscriptCI.passed || 0}/${manuscriptCI.required || 0} PASS` : "未通过"}；Prebuttal=${prebuttal.pass ? `PASS（decision-critical=${prebuttal.decision_critical || 0}）` : "未通过"}；Submission Ready receipt=${submissionReadiness.submission_ready ? `${hash12(submissionReadiness.receipt_sha256)}…` : "缺失"}。`, `Manuscript CI=${manuscriptCI.pass ? `${manuscriptCI.passed || 0}/${manuscriptCI.required || 0} PASS` : "not passed"}; Prebuttal=${prebuttal.pass ? `PASS (decision-critical=${prebuttal.decision_critical || 0})` : "not passed"}; Submission Ready receipt=${submissionReadiness.submission_ready ? `${hash12(submissionReadiness.receipt_sha256)}…` : "missing"}.`)}</p></article><article><b>${pick("最新复核 · Paper Preparation","Latest re-audit · Paper Preparation")}</b><span class="experiment-status-badge status-${!preparationRecorded ? "check" : preparation.pass ? "pass" : "fail"}">${!preparationRecorded ? "NOT RECORDED" : preparation.pass ? `${preparation.passed_gates || 0}/${preparation.required_gates || 0} PASS` : `${preparation.passed_gates || 0}/${preparation.required_gates || 0} FAIL`}</span><p>${pick(!preparationRecorded ? "当前公开投影没有 Paper Preparation receipt；不能据此把旧 Submission Ready receipt 升级解释为最新 gate-clean。" : preparation.pass ? `最新 Paper Preparation=${preparation.passed_gates || 0}/${preparation.required_gates || 0}，effective gate-clean=YES。` : `最新 Paper Preparation=${preparation.passed_gates || 0}/${preparation.required_gates || 0}，effective gate-clean=NO。${submissionContext.recommended_immediate_submission ? `当前建议=${submissionContext.recommended_immediate_submission}。` : ""}${submissionContext.support_blocker ? `support blocker=${submissionContext.support_blocker}。` : ""}`, !preparationRecorded ? "No Paper Preparation receipt is present in the current public projection; an older Submission Ready receipt must not be upgraded into a claim of current gate-clean readiness." : preparation.pass ? `Latest Paper Preparation=${preparation.passed_gates || 0}/${preparation.required_gates || 0}; effective gate-clean=YES.` : `Latest Paper Preparation=${preparation.passed_gates || 0}/${preparation.required_gates || 0}; effective gate-clean=NO. ${submissionContext.recommended_immediate_submission ? `Current recommendation=${submissionContext.recommended_immediate_submission}. ` : ""}${submissionContext.support_blocker ? `Support blocker=${submissionContext.support_blocker}.` : ""}`)}</p></article><article><b>${pick("科研与执行权限","Scientific / execution authority")}</b><span class="experiment-status-badge status-pass">0 AUTO AUTHORITY</span><p>${pick(`scientific=${authority.scientific ? 1 : 0} · experiment=${authority.experiment ? 1 : 0} · GPU=${authority.gpu ? 1 : 0} · submission=${authority.submission ? 1 : 0}。论文工作流只优化叙事、成稿和防御，不会把 reviewer 意见自动变成实验或科学结论。`,`scientific=${authority.scientific ? 1 : 0} · experiment=${authority.experiment ? 1 : 0} · GPU=${authority.gpu ? 1 : 0} · submission=${authority.submission ? 1 : 0}. The paper workflow optimizes narrative, manuscript, and reviewer defense; reviewer feedback never becomes an experiment or scientific conclusion automatically.`)}</p></article></div><div class="current-status-rule"><b>${pick("当前下一步","Current next step")}</b><span>${esc(next)}</span></div><div class="system-retro-note"><b>${pick("Ledger 完整性","Ledger integrity")}: </b>${pick(`canonical papers=${summary.registered_papers ?? system.ledger_index?.summary?.papers ?? 0} · invalid=${summary.invalid_ledgers ?? system.ledger_index?.summary?.invalid_ledgers ?? 0} · scientific holds=${summary.scientific_holds ?? system.ledger_index?.summary?.scientific_holds ?? 0}。公开页面只读取安全投影，不展示 raw reviewer prose、actor 或私有文件路径。`,`canonical papers=${summary.registered_papers ?? system.ledger_index?.summary?.papers ?? 0} · invalid=${summary.invalid_ledgers ?? system.ledger_index?.summary?.invalid_ledgers ?? 0} · scientific holds=${summary.scientific_holds ?? system.ledger_index?.summary?.scientific_holds ?? 0}. The public page reads the safe projection only; raw reviewer prose, actors, and private filesystem paths are excluded.`)}</div></section>`;
